{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33969","headline":"夏初访鲁望偶题小斋 · 皮日休","name":"夏初访鲁望偶题小斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半里芳阴到陆家，藜牀相劝饭胡麻。\n林间度宿抛棊局，壁上经旬挂钓车。\n野客病时分竹米，邻翁斋日乞藤花。\n踟蹰爲放闲人去，半[岸]纱帩待月华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33969.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33969","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}